      "text": "Settings → preload course IPC → main → course.ts → OpenAI vector store. The folder and subfolders are uploaded; only metadata stays local.\nSaved course ID reaches planLesson; the model decides whether to use file_search. Jev still owns screenshot and drawing decisions.\nChanging folders replaces the index; Remove attempts remote cleanup. Existing cleanup failures can leave files in OpenAI.",
